{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42798","headline":"从弟舍人惠茶 · 刘兼","name":"从弟舍人惠茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾求芳茗贡芜词，果沐颁沾味甚奇。\n龟背起纹轻炙处，云头翻液乍烹时。\n老丞倦闷偏宜矣，旧客过从别有之。\n珍重宗亲相寄惠，水亭山阁自携持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}